  "conclusion": "The independent AutoCAD 2016 Palette Release candidate is reproducibly compiled and passed the exact project, source, dependency, output, IL, registration, and fail-closed API gates under PowerShell 7 and Windows PowerShell 5.1. The user explicitly confirmed that NETLOAD selected the frozen 90620E...01DFE candidate. After initially contaminated samples, a valid same-process isolation retest held all six DBMOD observations at 4 and increased generation/reset/release by exactly one. The current 96 DPI/100% left/right docking, floating, hide/reopen, Chinese IME and line-break matrix also passed with final DBMOD 4. The 125% and 150% DPI sessions and AutoCAD exit lifecycle remain deferred, so this establishes a scope-limited Palette runtime checkpoint rather than complete Palette-stage or full AutoCAD 2016 support."
